{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tuplet element is present when a tuplet is to be displayed graphically, in addition to the sound data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provided by the time-modification elements. The number attribute is used to distinguish nested tuplets. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bracket attribute is used to indicate the presence of a bracket. If unspecified, the results are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"implementation-dependent. The line-shape attribute is used to specify whether the bracket is straight or in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the older curved or slurred style. It is straight by default."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SH","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLTuplet"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Whereas a time-modification element shows how the cumulative, sounding effect of tuplets and double-note","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tremolos compare to the written note type, the tuplet element describes how this is displayed. The tuplet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"element also provides more detailed representation information than the time-modification element, and is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"needed to represent nested tuplets and other complex tuplets accurately.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The show-number attribute is used to display either the number of actual notes, the number of both actual and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"normal notes, or neither. It is actual by default. The show-type attribute is used to display either the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"actual type, both the actual and normal types, or neither. It is none by default.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Maps the MusicXML ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<tuplet>"},{"type":"text","text":" element."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltuplet"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/Portion"],"title":"Structures","generated":true,"anchor":"Structures"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/init(id:actual:normal:kind:number:hasBracket:showNumber:showType:lineShape:position:placement:)"],"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/actual","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/hasBracket","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/id","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/kind","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/lineShape","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/normal","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/number","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/placement","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/position","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/showNumber","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTuplet\/showType"],"tit